@dialect harness-seq/1
@seq 1
@entry RESEARCH_LOCAL
🔎 RESEARCH_LOCAL
ordinary_repository_file_lookup ∧ delegation_runtime_permits ⇒ AGENT_ROUTER→FileReader(read-only; hits=only(repository-relative-path,line_number)-tuples, no status prefix; completed_zero_hits=exactly NO_MATCH; operational/search/permission/IO_failure=sanitized FAILED; ¬excerpt|snippet|match_text|content|summary|absolute_path)
ordinary_repository_file_lookup ∧ ¬delegation_runtime_permits ⇒ ESCALATE(no_dispatch; no_local_fallback; no_claimed_result)
stuck ∨ sparse/repetitive_investigation ⇒ Explorer(broad_high_recall; preserve current role)
valid_local_review ⇒ LOCAL_REVIEW
otherwise ⇒ LOCAL_RESEARCH
🔎 LOCAL_REVIEW
Obj(LocalReview{query,targets}) → Mor(invoke-local-review.ps1) → ReviewReport
⊢ collector=bounded-read-only ∧ no_task_artifact_writes
ERROR ⇒ Evidence(review=FAILED(non_secret_cause)) → FINISH
ReviewReport ⇒ FINISH
🔎 LOCAL_RESEARCH
Obj(LocalResearch{query,scope}) → Mor(local.evidence) → Evidence
⊢ local_or_private_target(scope)
⊢ web=N_A(local_evidence_only) unless public facts are required
🔎 EPUB
⊢ explicit_EPUB_request ∨ applicable_public_search_insufficient
Mor(kavita-fetch-search.search[keywords]) → Sources
EMPTY ⇒ Evidence(epub=N_A(no_hit))
ERROR ⇒ Evidence(epub=FAILED(non_secret_cause))
not_applicable ⇒ Evidence(epub=N_A(local_evidence_only))
🔎 MEMORY
current_task_precedent_exists ⇒ reuse(Evidence(memory))
otherwise ⇒ search
Obj(Task{keywords}) → Mor(llm-mem.search[level=2,json]) → Precedents
ERROR ∨ missing_executable ⇒ Evidence(memory=FAILED(non_secret_cause))
⊢ report={Facts,Inferences,Unknowns,Sources,Precedents,Constraints}
task:change ⇒ CHANGE → load(change.seq) → 🧠 PLAN
otherwise ⇒ FINISH
